5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I’m worried we’re guessing again. Last year’s numbers felt shaky, and I don’t want to set fees blind.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The evenings feel heavier lately. People hesitate before coming out. I’d like to understand why that changed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It’s always the same dozen faces doing everything. I want to see who’s actually carrying the load.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to know what the bookkeeping job really costs in time before we pick a collection method.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about how visible the new rules will be. Newcomers need to feel they can drift in easily.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if the job is too heavy, maybe the fee structure should make it easier?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, if the same people do everything, does that mean others feel less ownership?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, exactly. If they don’t show up, why should they pay the same?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, I’m looking at the hours. If chasing money takes six hours a month, that’s a problem.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I just want to make sure we don’t scare people off with complicated tiers or charges.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I think we need to look at the actual costs first. No point arguing about fees if we don’t know the baseline.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. But I also want to see if the hesitation is about the money or the social pressure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’m going to check the sign-in sheets. I bet the numbers are worse than we think.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look at the treasurer’s logs and the bank statements. I need to see the effort involved.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll look at the taster forms and the mid-year joiners. I want to see why people hesitate to commit.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Okay, let’s go look at the data. I’ll check the ledger and the bank statements to see where the money goes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look at the weekday turnout and the winter social feedback. I want to see the social side.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’ll check the sign-in sheets and the rota. I need to see the imbalance clearly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look at the treasurer’s hours and the mid-year joiner records. I need to see the administrative burden.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’ll look at the taster forms and the winter social feedback. I want to understand the newcomer experience.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
